      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Start by setting up deterministic tests using environment isolation tools like DoT (Deterministic) or Staging to ensure every container shares identical network and resource dependencies across runs. You should also enable Jenkins agent-specific logging tools or rotate shell scripts to consistently capture the exact state of shared resources like Docker Daemon or Kubernetes State changes. This will help you pinpoint whether intermittent failures stem from external services or race conditions within your CI environment.",
